{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Validate the config before consuming the provider builder.** With a null config, this overload mutates the caller\u2019s builder and builds an `SdkTracerProvider` before line 61 throws. The newly built provider is then unreachable and cannot close its processors or worker threads. Reject the null config before any builder mutation or build, and cover the absence of those side effects in the test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7xhpCi","finding_digest":"bfdf501c2f90588db6f8d321b3c358f71ef3080c83258242e2856f63bcebea48","finding_id":"arf_v1_x7pvahbpsbmi3nxy2mq3hq2y64","finding_key":"otel-plugin/otelpluginenvironment::forproviderbuilder::validate-before-provider-build","identity_key":"otel-plugin/otelpluginenvironment::forproviderbuilder::validate-before-provider-build","line":55,"observation_digest":"28fbdc8b770ad5674765a1c3148f959c7b7b4f421abc848db09f841df0d9f937","observation_id":"aro_v1_fd55zc3xblkwor3fuhbrjd4vtr","path":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/OtelPluginEnvironment.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-19T03:55:01Z","review_id":"arr_v1_iddtcg2eocthh34iuxnhvpmgsy","reviewed_base_sha":"dd19d8efc275c4cf97e34338fff51f53957e42c6","reviewed_head_sha":"39a84aa4cdf4c23132b47a6388f71b34f6a39d43","reviewer":"codex","start_line":54,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_447bwfoljzlzdx2cttgs3r6jza"},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_dxlqqxy4auf7gxvgjhrmmfuwla","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-19T03:55:01Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
